# fp4: Agon 08_sand_casualpirates layer 2 (the area with water): the four aerotroopers activated
# beside the god-mode player, so Think runs in the water area with the forced scenarios of
# flyingpirate_fp3.py (water arms: InFluidId naming the CScriptWater, trigger bounds above/below).
@f300 layer 2
@f560 god 1
@f580 send u0545 Activate; send u053d Activate; send u0539 Activate; send u0537 Activate
@f600 tp 355 -265 4
@f610 face 0
@f1000 shoot u0545
@f1300 shoot u053d missile
@f1500 obj u0545
